graph TD
    %% Clients
    Client[Pelanggan / Mobile App]
    RestoApp[Aplikasi Resto]
    DriverApp[Aplikasi Kurir]

    %% Infrastructure
    Gateway[API Gateway]
    Broker[Message Broker\nRabbitMQ / Kafka]

    %% Core Services
    OrderSvc[Service Pesanan\nOrder Service]
    PaySvc[Service Pembayaran\nPayment Service]
    CatalogSvc[Service Katalog Resto\nCatalog Service]
    NotifSvc[Service Notifikasi\nNotification Service]
    CourierSvc[Service Kurir\nCourier Service]

    %% Synchronous Request-Response Flow
    Client -->|1. HTTP REST\nLihat menu| Gateway
    Gateway -->|1a. Request/Response| CatalogSvc

    Client -->|2. HTTP REST\nBuat Pesanan| Gateway
    Gateway -->|2a. Request/Response| OrderSvc

    OrderSvc -->|3. REST / gRPC Sinkron\nProses Bayar| PaySvc
    PaySvc -- Output Status --> OrderSvc

    %% Asynchronous Event-Driven Flow (Pub-Sub)
    OrderSvc -->|4. Publish Event\n'OrderPaid'| Broker

    Broker -->|5a. Subscribe Event| NotifSvc
    Broker -->|5b. Subscribe Event| CourierSvc
    Broker -->|5c. Subscribe Event| RestoApp

    NotifSvc -->|6a. Push Notification| Client
    CourierSvc -->|6b. Penugasan Driver| DriverApp
